| !Run for !Groove
| !RunImage is a UnixLib program converted to Absolute (AIF), so it needs
| SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport (both from PackMan). SharedSound is
| part of RISC OS 5.
Set Groove$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Groove$Dir>.!Sprites
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Groove needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error Groove needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure SharedSound 0 Error Groove needs the SharedSound module, which comes with RISC OS 5.
WimpSlot -min 3072K -max 3072K
Run <Groove$Dir>.!RunImage
